bee-pagoda (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * CPU benchmark: sysbench baseline, 7z compression, ffmpeg encode with pre-probe.
  * GPU benchmark: vendor auto-detection (NVIDIA/AMD/Intel/Generic).
  * AI benchmark: llama.cpp, ONNX Runtime, PyTorch multi-backend composite.
  * Memory benchmark: sysbench memory + tinymembench.
  * Storage benchmark: fio sequential + random 4K.
  * Stress domain: mixed load, throttling detection, thermal trend.
  * Web dashboard: 3-tab HTML/JS results viewer + launcher.
  * SQLite trend history, normalized health bands, compare-to-previous reports.
  * Profiles: quick, balanced, deep, ai-focus, gaming-focus, storage-focus.

